{
  "id": "PSA.64",
  "number": "64",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 64",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "64",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 64"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "64",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Psaume de David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Écoute, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.64.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.64.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! ma voix, quand je me plains ; garde ma vie de la crainte de l'ennemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cache-moi loin du conseil secret des méchants, et de la foule tumultueuse des ouvriers d'iniquité,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui ont aiguisé leur langue comme une épée, ajusté leur flèche, – une parole amère,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour tirer de leurs cachettes contre celui qui est intègre : soudain ils tirent sur lui, et ils ne craignent pas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils s'affermissent dans de mauvaises choses, ils s'entretiennent ensemble pour cacher des pièges ; ils disent : Qui le verra ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils méditent des méchancetés : Nous avons fini ; la machination est ourdie. L'intérieur de chacun, et le cœur, est profond.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.64.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.64.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tirera sa flèche contre eux : soudain ils sont blessés ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et leur langue les fera tomber les uns par-dessus les autres ; tous ceux qui les voient s'enfuiront.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et tous les hommes craindront, et ils raconteront les actes de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.64.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.64.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", et considéreront son œuvre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 64:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le juste se réjouira en l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.64.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.64.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et se confiera en lui, et tous ceux qui sont droits de cœur se glorifieront.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.65",
    "number": "65",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.63",
